al":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FZF7z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27fbe889-4e8c-4b53-ab78-8a941ffdfeb4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"POSTとかならOPTIONSメソッドもJSでfetchすればブラウザ勝手に投げてくれる。","ts":"1616555916.081900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FLv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f9dbcc4-2ea8-4803-aeff-b0118759c5e7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"サーバーがAccess-Control-Allow-Originヘッダーを返すかどうかというところに帰着する。","ts":"1616555869.081200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1616555877.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I74f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9544cc65-408b-41e8-8945-575980f3d93e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"んー誤解してない? CORSはクライアント側=JS側ではなにもやることなくてfetchとかすれば勝手にチェックやってくれて、","ts":"1616555830.080700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qAwmz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd010851-4afa-428e-9f4c-17ff1456b924","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"log 側で JS 動かす想定です","ts":"1616555688.079500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z8Ul"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f7a05b1-de51-490b-a54e-901c8ff50b3a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"CORSは外部化した向こう側の問題だから、log本体では気にせんと良いのでは。","ts":"1616550453.079200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iPHPC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0b478c0-c8e9-4df3-a812-85edd0b2d399","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"アップロードされたテキストファイルの埋め込みを html に直をやめて JS 経由で fetch してやろうかと思ったのだけど、\nそして実装もできたのだけど、\n将来的にファイルを外部化した場合、CORS の問題が起きることに気付いた…。うーん…。","ts":"1616518489.078600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lW9"}]}]
